RimeIce.Basic.Hint = Each switch has three states: remembered (default for Rime Ice), fixed on, or fixed off.
RimeIce.SaveOptions.Note = "Remember" adds the switch to switcher/save_options so Rime keeps your last choice after switching schemas. "Fixed on/off" writes reset and is removed from save_options.
