Packages.How.Note = Installing is more than unzipping — every step keeps a way back, which is what makes removal safe to press.
Packages.How.Step1 = 1. Download the package (mirrors first) and extract it into your Rime user directory; any file about to be overwritten is backed up first.
Packages.How.Step2 = 2. Record every installed file path in a manifest, then add the schema to your schema list and deploy automatically.
Packages.How.Step3 = 3. Removal deletes only the files listed in that manifest and restores the backups — files you already had are never touched.
